  "description": {
    "text": "The EX Trainer Kit 2, released in March 2006, followed the first kit with two 30-card half decks, Plusle and Minun, plus an EX booster pack, a rule book, damage and status counters, a coin and a playmat. Each half deck's cards carry the kit's own set symbol and number and no rarity mark, and all are reprints from EX Hidden Legends, EX FireRed & LeafGreen, EX Team Rocket Returns, EX Deoxys and EX Emerald except the two holo cards.\n\nThe Minun half deck runs on Fire and Lightning Energy and holds twelve different cards, 1/12 to 12/12. Its holo Minun had until then come only in the Japanese Mirage's Mew Constructed Starter Deck.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: EX Trainer Kit 2 (TCG) (Wayback Machine copy, 14 September 2026)",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20260914024349/https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/EX_Trainer_Kit_2_(TCG)"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "The Minun half-deck symbol, and a number out of 12",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: EX Trainer Kit 2 (TCG) (Wayback Machine copy, 14 September 2026)",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20260914024349/https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/EX_Trainer_Kit_2_(TCG)"
      }
    ]
  },
